Q9.14
question: What must pass before Core freezes?
options: four checked representative proofs / prose inventory / full-language soundness first
reason: Check reset generativity/dependencies, deferred allocator/loan cleanup, heap opening/mutable lending and one values-to-bytes lemma; return substantive formalization discoveries to A2.
