ROADMAP.md:486:| R-0584 | A minimal direct-syscall launcher written in Concrete | the launcher that mints `main`'s grants is a small Concrete program compiled through the verified path and making system calls directly, so no C runtime or libc start-up stays in the trusted base; OS-level sandboxing (seccomp/landlock, Capsicum, pledge/unveil) is outside the compiler's scope; users may apply it themselves. | R-0505 |

