Only final verdicts are used; agy’s repo claims were unverified by that reviewer. References are relative to this directory’s parent. Core-row details were checked in [core_rows.json](../docs/archive/decisions-2026-11-05/core_rows.json), which decisions.md incorporates; row notes govern over R4 where they differ. Agreement verdicts are included for coverage.

- Codex S1 — accepted: quote the supplied 2026-11-07 owner answer verbatim, mark recording pending, and reconcile the interface/law freeze with [A2i](../docs/decisions.md#decided-project-long-term-2026-11-06), which rejects an untested whole-language architecture.
